      "description": [
        {
          "content": "<p>Reset cached measurements for a specific cell.\nThis should be called when a cell needs to be re-measured to handle dynamic content\n(e.g. replacing a loading indicator with loaded content, or reacting to state changes for stateful cells).\n<code>columnIndex</code> defaults to <code>0</code>.</p>\n"
        }
      ],
      "html": "<div><span class=\"tok-variableName\">clear</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"tok-variableName\">rowIndex</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> number</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">,</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-variableName\">columnIndex</span><span class=\"tok-operator\">?</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-variableName\">number</span><span class=\"\">)</span><span class=\"tok-operator\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-keyword\">void</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">;</span></div>",
      "name": "clear"
    },
    {
      "description": [
        {
          "content": "<p>Reset cached measurements for all cells.\nThis should be called when a <code>Grid</code>, <code>List</code> or <code>Table</code> needs to reflow its content due to a resize in a responsive layout\n(e.g. a change in window width may impact the height of cells).</p>\n"
        }
      ],
      "html": "<div><span class=\"tok-variableName\">clearAll</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-keyword\">void</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">;</span></div>",
      "name": "clearAll"
    },
    {
      "description": [
        {
          "content": "<p>Returns the derived width of a column (its widest measured cell) or the default width.\nPass this as the <code>columnWidth</code> prop of a <code>Grid</code> (or <code>MultiGrid</code>);\nit's bound to the cache, so it can be passed as-is.</p>\n"
        }
      ],
